### TeX ###
## Core latex/pdflatex auxiliary files:
*.aux
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.fls
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk

## Build folders (keep PDFs tracked or untracked as you prefer)
# Option 1: Ignore all build artifacts including PDFs
applications/*/build/
shared/build/
_base/build/

# Option 2: Keep PDFs, ignore only temp files (uncomment below, comment above)
applications/*/build/*.aux
applications/*/build/*.log
applications/*/build/*.fls 
applications/*/build/*.fdb_latexmk
applications/*/build/*.synctex.gz

## Intermediate documents:
*.dvi
*-converted-to.*

### Editor ###
## Vim & Emacs temp files:
.*sw[op]
*~

### Mac OS X ###
## Mac OS X metadata files:
*.DS_Store

# pixi environments
.pixi/*
!.pixi/config.toml
